8. UNIVERSAL PDF, OCR AND IMAGE PROCESSING

Create one reusable PDF processing pipeline.

Required workflow:

PDF Upload → File Validation → Classification → Page Inspection → Text Extraction → Image Extraction → OCR → Table Extraction → Formula Extraction → AI Fallback if needed → Extraction Validation → Structured Output.

